{"title":"California mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#California_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">California middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#California_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">California high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"California_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">California middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=California_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: California middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=298\">middle school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=California_MathCounts\" title=\"California MathCounts\">California MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bay_Area_Mathematical_Olympiad_(BAMO)\" title=\"Bay Area Mathematical Olympiad (BAMO)\">Bay Area Mathematical Olympiad (BAMO)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcircle.berkeley.edu/BMC6/pages/BAMO/bamo.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=California_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"California Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">California Mathematics League</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gunn_Math_Competition_(GMC)\" title=\"Gunn Math Competition (GMC)\">Gunn Math Competition (GMC)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://compete.gunnmathcircle.org\">website</a> is a middle and high school competition held at Gunn High School, with a good math team that has won at other competitions such as Stanford Math Tournament and Harvard-MIT Math Tournament.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza\" title=\"Canyon Crest Academy Math Bonanza\">Canyon Crest Academy Math Bonanza</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ccamb.org\">website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://harkermathinvitational.org\">Harker Math Invitational (HMI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Field_Day_for_San_Diego_Middle_Schools&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Math Field Day for San Diego Middle Schools (page does not exist)\">Math Field Day for San Diego Middle Schools</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://best.me.berkeley.edu/%7Eaagogino/IU/mdrules/mathsenior.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Polya_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Polya Competition (page does not exist)\">Polya Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.castilleja.org/faculty/josh_zucker/polya/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Redwood_Empire_Mathematics_Tournament_hosted_by_Humboldt_State&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Redwood Empire Mathematics Tournament hosted by Humboldt State (page does not exist)\">Redwood Empire Mathematics Tournament hosted by Humboldt State</a>- middle and high school <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.humboldt.edu/%7Eremt/\">website</a></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_League\" title=\"San Diego Math League\">San Diego Math League</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Olympiad\" title=\"San Diego Math Olympiad\">San Diego Math Olympiad</a> hosted by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Circle\" title=\"San Diego Math Circle\">San Diego Math Circle</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/SDMC/AoPS_S_Schedule.php\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Jose_JACL-Tokutomi_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"San Jose JACL-Tokutomi Mathematics Contest (page does not exist)\">San Jose JACL-Tokutomi Mathematics Contest</a>- for grades 7-12. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.sanjosejacl.org/math.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathleague&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mathleague (page does not exist)\">Mathleague</a>- elementary, middle, high school. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mathleague.org\">website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mathnasium.com/trimathlon\">National Trimathlon</a> is a fun filled Math Competition for kids in grades 3 through 6.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/tka-math-tournament/home\">The King's Academy Math Tournament (TKAMT)</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"California_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">California high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=California_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: California high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=214\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gunn_Math_Competition_(GMC)\" title=\"Gunn Math Competition (GMC)\">Gunn Math Competition (GMC)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://compete.gunnmathcircle.org\">website</a> is a middle and high school competition held at Gunn High School, with a good math team that has won at other competitions such as Stanford Math Tournament and Harvard-MIT Math Tournament.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza\" title=\"Canyon Crest Academy Math Bonanza\">Canyon Crest Academy Math Bonanza</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ccamb.org\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bay_Area_Mathematical_Olympiad_(BAMO)\" title=\"Bay Area Mathematical Olympiad (BAMO)\">Bay Area Mathematical Olympiad (BAMO)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.bamo.org/\">[1]</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Berkeley_Math_Tournament\" title=\"Berkeley Math Tournament\">Berkeley Math Tournament</a>, hosted at UC Berkeley <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//berkeley.mt\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=California_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"California Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">California Mathematics League</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Caltech_Math_Meet\" title=\"Caltech Math Meet\">Caltech Math Meet</a> (formerly Caltech Harvey Mudd Math Competition) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.caltechmathmeet.org/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Canyon_Crest_Academy_Math_Bonanza\" title=\"Canyon Crest Academy Math Bonanza\">Canyon Crest Academy Math Bonanza</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ccamb.org\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Los_Angeles_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Los Angeles Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">Los Angeles Math Tournament</a>, hosted at UCLA <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lamt.net/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LACC_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"LACC Math Contest (page does not exist)\">LACC Math Contest</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.lacitycollege.edu/academic/departments/mathdept/contest.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Lawrence_Livermore_National_Laboratories_Annual_High_School_Math_Challenge&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Lawrence Livermore National Laboratories Annual High School Math Challenge (page does not exist)\">Lawrence Livermore National Laboratories Annual High School Math Challenge</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.lacitycollege.edu/academic/departments/math/mathdept/contest/index.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Day_at_the_Beach\" title=\"Math Day at the Beach\">Math Day at the Beach</a> hosted by CSULB <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.csulb.edu/mathematics-statistics/math-day-at-the-beach\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Polya_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Polya Competition (page does not exist)\">Polya Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.castilleja.org/faculty/josh_zucker/polya/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pomona_College_Mathematical_Talent_Search&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Pomona College Mathematical Talent Search (page does not exist)\">Pomona College Mathematical Talent Search</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.math.pomona.edu/talentsearch.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Redwood_Empire_Mathematics_Tournament_hosted_by_Humboldt_State&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Redwood Empire Mathematics Tournament hosted by Humboldt State (page does not exist)\">Redwood Empire Mathematics Tournament hosted by Humboldt State</a>- middle and high school <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.humboldt.edu/%7Eremt/\">website</a></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_League\" title=\"San Diego Math League\">San Diego Math League</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Olympiad\" title=\"San Diego Math Olympiad\">San Diego Math Olympiad</a> hosted by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Circle\" title=\"San Diego Math Circle\">San Diego Math Circle</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/SDMC/AoPS_S_Schedule.php\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Jose_JACL-Tokutomi_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"San Jose JACL-Tokutomi Mathematics Contest (page does not exist)\">San Jose JACL-Tokutomi Mathematics Contest</a>- for grades 7-12. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.sanjosejacl.org/math.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Santa_Clara_University_High_School_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Santa Clara University High School Mathematics Contest (page does not exist)\">Santa Clara University High School Mathematics Contest</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://math.scu.edu/activities/hscontest.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Southern_California_Mathematics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Southern California Mathematics Competition (page does not exist)\">Southern California Mathematics Competition</a>, hosted at USC <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sites.google.com/usc.edu/scmathcompetition/home\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stanford_Mathematics_Tournament\" title=\"Stanford Mathematics Tournament\">Stanford Mathematics Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.stanford.edu/group/sumo/smt/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UCSD/GSDMC_High_School_Honors_Mathematics_Contest\" title=\"UCSD/GSDMC High School Honors Mathematics Contest\">UCSD/GSDMC High School Honors Mathematics Contest</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.math.ucsd.edu/resources/honors_math_contest/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=California_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=California_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_circles\" title=\"Math circles\">Math circles</a> -- There are many in California.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018052313\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 52/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\n